# SPA fallback for Vue Router's createWebHistory, so a direct load/refresh of
# e.g. /weekly-plan is served index.html instead of 404ing.
#
# NOTE: as of this writing, Render's own docs (render.com/docs/redirects-rewrites)
# document rewrites only via the Dashboard or render.yaml's `routes` key — a
# Netlify-style _redirects file is NOT confirmed/documented as supported by
# Render. This file is included as a harmless, zero-cost fallback in case
# Render does honor it, but the deployment does NOT rely on it: the actual,
# verified fix is the `routes` rewrite rule on the static site service in
# render.yaml at the repo root.
/*  /index.html  200
